&lt;/video&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LIO-SAM Screenshot:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/saikiran_juttu.github.io/saikiran_juttu.github.io/uploads/lio_sam.png&#34; alt=&#34;LIO-SAM Visualization&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;uav-motion-planning&#34;&gt;UAV Motion Planning&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developed &lt;strong&gt;waypoint navigation and motion planning&lt;/strong&gt; pipelines for &lt;strong&gt;Crazyflie and DJI Tello&lt;/strong&gt; using the &lt;strong&gt;OptiTrack motion capture system&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automated takeoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Precision landing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closed-loop control with state estimation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;semantic-perception-with-vlms&#34;&gt;Semantic Perception with VLMs&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exploring integration of &lt;strong&gt;Vision-Language Models (VLMs)&lt;/strong&gt; to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance indoor semantic navigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce localization drift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable autonomous scene understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
